\label{subsec:procedure}

The study was conducted over a single afternoon session for each group (to prevent contamination), following the timeline shown in Figure~\ref{fig:method_overview}.

\textit{Pre-test (20 min).} Prior to any instruction, all participants completed:
\begin{itemize}
    \item The \textbf{Light Deflection Concept Inventory (LDCI)} (20 items, Cronbach's $\alpha = 0.87$)
    \item The \textbf{Purdue Spatial Visualization Test: Rotations (PSVT:R)} \cite{guay1976spatial}, a validated 30-item multiple-choice test of spatial reasoning, to control for individual differences in visuospatial ability (Cronbach's $\alpha = 0.82$ in pilot)
\end{itemize}

