\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Conceptual understanding:} 20 multiple-choice items targeting the nature of null geodesics, role of acceleration, weak-field approximation, and common misconceptions (e.g., photons "falling" due to mass, confusion between coordinate systems and physical reality). Cronbach's $\alpha = 0.87$.
