    \item \textbf{Transfer:} Qualitative explanation of gravitational time dilation in an accelerating frame using the equivalence principle, assessed with a 5-point conceptual rubric (inter-rater reliability $\kappa = 0.78$).
    \item \textbf{Cognitive load:} NASA-TLX questionnaire with six subscales (mental demand, physical demand, temporal demand, performance, effort, frustration) on a 1--21 scale; overall weighted score computed per Hartel et al. (2020) \cite{hartle2020}.
\end{itemize}
